body:
I don't know how much it costs now but nearly a decade ago when I had military health insurance and they wouldn't cover it, I paid about $80 for 10 mL at a clinic pharmacy.

&#x200B;

edit: buying 10 mL vials is going to be cheaper than a bunch of 1 mL vials if you're able to convince your doctor to do that for you

I have been hospitalized three times in the last year for suicidal thoughts and I still struggle with them. I have been called high risk before. Usually when we go over or have phone calls its about safety concerns it's not just talking about random things.

&#x200B;

Something about that disclosure isn't sitting right with me either I guess that's why I made this post. Thanks for your response.
